      "text": "@JeffreyGuterman @Bizzznisss isn't someone who knows how to regularly abuse human rights the correct expert to ID human rights abuse?",
      "timestamp": "Sun Aug 17 22:50:33 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.011367654034186e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500353906388791296",
      "text": "@khamenei_ir is the pot calling the kettle black. Hypocrite much ?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 18:50:42 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003504601221366e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500351755708682241",
      "text": "You will have moral standing in the area of #HumanRIghts when you release the political prisoners held in Evin prison @khamenei_ir",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 18:42:09 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003504601221366e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500363510312747011",
      "text": "also, #YesAllWomen RT @khamenei_ir The flag of #HumanRights is borne by enemies of human rights w/US leading them! #Ferguson",
      "timestamp": "Fri Aug 15 19:28:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.003504601221366e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500970834526498816",
      "text": "@IRAN9821 That list seems to show that numbers of race riots have been in decline since the 60s, but it is undeniable that racism persists.",
