      "parent_id": 5.0095589923907994e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "500616542363865091",
      "text": "@IRAN9821 @HakeemTheRoots @khamenei_ir America is a big place, with lots of contradictory realities. Obama's elections are also meaningful.",
